    newsTitle: '📮 Mail from the developers', newsSub: 'Fresh CapyTap news',
    newsIntro: 'Hi, friend! This time the news is in a newspaper: a clock tower, a new loading screen and many small things. Turn the pages!',
    newsH0: 'A newspaper instead of a letter.', newsT0: 'The mail from the developers is now a newspaper: it unfolds and the pages turn. Swipe, tap or use the arrows.',
    newsH1: 'The clock tower.', newsT1: 'A big clock tower rose on the mall. Before the trip it strikes: once on the first night, twice on the second and three times on the third. Tap it to set off for a new era.',
    newsH2: 'New loading screen.', newsT2: 'A lively night city with windows, cars and birds, and useful tips below. Tap a tip to see the next one.',
    newsH3: 'A new witch.', newsT3: 'The witch on a broom got prettier: a big hat, a fluffy broom and a trail of stars.',
    newsH4: 'Bigger markets.', newsT4: 'On a vertical phone markets of every level are bigger and the brown strips at the edges are gone.',
    newsH5: 'Bitten clouds.', newsT5: 'In the Cotton Clouds skin some of the clouds look as if somebody took a bite.',
    newsH6: 'The rain drop.', newsT6: 'The little drop that turns the rain on now hangs on the right by the shop sign.',
    newsH7: 'Crisp frames.', newsT7: 'Menu frames have a clear outline on all sides, and tab labels no longer hide under the padlock.',
    newsH8: 'Capy at night.', newsT8: 'In the dark Capy gets a warm outline so she stands out, and the fog no longer veils the animals.',
    newsSign: 'Thanks for playing! Tell us what you want to see next. — The CapyTap team', newsClose: 'Got it!',
