    skinSay_capy_knight: "My sword is sharp and my prices are fair. Almost.", skinSay_capy_hero: "My superpower is discounts. The cape is free.", skinSay_capy_cowboy: "This town has one sheriff. And he sells things.", skinSay_capy_fairy: "A pinch of magic, and the price tags jump to the sky.", skinSay_capy_viking: "To the sale! Raid the discounts!", skinSay_capy_pilot: "Fasten your seatbelts: our profit is gaining altitude.",
    skin_capy_gold: 'Golden Capy', skin_capy_diamond: 'Diamond Capy', skin_hero_gold: 'Golden heroes', skin_hero_diamond: 'Diamond heroes', skin_shop_diamond: 'Diamond shop', skin_street_diamond: 'Diamond road', skin_weather_diamondcloud: 'Diamond clouds',
    skinSay_capy_gold: "Golden fur and no discount on the shine. Well, for you there is one.", skinSay_capy_diamond: "Diamond Capy. Tap boldly: I sparkle, but I am tough as crystal.", skinSay_hero_gold: "Golden helpers: they work like clockwork and shine like coins.", skinSay_hero_diamond: "Diamond helpers shine so much the till squints.", skinSay_shop_diamond: "A diamond shop! Crystal windows and crystal-honest prices.", skinSay_street_diamond: "A diamond road. Walking on it feels like walking on a chandelier.", skinSay_weather_diamondcloud: "Diamond clouds: not rain here, but sparks.",
    skin_capy_pirate: 'Pirate Capy', skin_capy_astro: 'Astronaut Capy', skin_shop_candy: 'Candy shop', skin_shop_gold: 'Golden shop', skin_weather_rainbow: 'Rainbow over town', skin_weather_lightning: 'Purple lightning', skin_street_moss: 'Mossy cobbles', skin_street_gold: 'Golden road', skin_weather_lightninggreen: 'Green lightning', skin_weather_lightningred: 'Red lightning', skin_capy_wizard: 'Wizard Capy', skin_capy_chef: 'Chef Capy', skin_capy_explorer: 'Explorer Capy', skin_capy_detective: 'Detective Capy', skin_capy_sailor: 'Sailor Capy', skin_shop_ice: 'Ice shop', skin_shop_wood: 'Wooden cabin', skin_shop_garden: 'Garden shop', skin_weather_cottoncloud: 'Cotton-candy clouds', skin_weather_goldcloud: 'Golden clouds', skin_weather_starcloud: 'Starry clouds', skin_hero_chef: 'Chef heroes', skin_hero_wizard: 'Wizard heroes', skin_hero_royal: 'Royal heroes', skin_capy_santa: 'Santa Capy', skin_capy_witch: 'Witch Capy', skin_capy_flower: 'Flower Capy', skin_capy_beach: 'Beach Capy', skin_capy_autumn: 'Autumn Capy', skin_hero_santa: 'Santa’s helpers', skin_hero_witch: 'Little witches', skin_shop_xmas: 'Christmas shop', skin_shop_halloween: 'Halloween shop', skin_shop_spring: 'Spring shop', skin_shop_autumn: 'Autumn shop', skin_street_snow: 'Snowy cobbles', skin_street_leaves: 'Leafy cobbles', skin_capy_mel: 'Capy the fox Mel', skin_capy_nika: 'Capy the bunny Nika', skinSay_capy_mel: 'I am Mel the fox. Sly only about the price: the price is fair, the discount is a secret.', skinSay_capy_nika: 'I am Nika the bunny. I hop to the till faster than the queue!', skinSay_capy_pirate: "Yo-ho-ho! Every coin is treasure, and the shop is my ship!", skinSay_capy_astro: "Houston, we have a sale! The orbit of prices is here.", skinSay_shop_candy: "It smells of caramel in here. I do not lick the walls. Almost.", skinSay_shop_gold: "The golden shop shines so bright the cashier wears sunglasses.", skinSay_weather_rainbow: "A rainbow over town. Where is the pot of gold? Oh, that is the till!", skinSay_weather_lightning: "Purple lightning? That is not a storm, that is a promo!", skinSay_hero_party: "A party every day! Confetti helpers, serious prices.", skinSay_hero_ninja: "Ninja helpers are here. You have not seen them. And you will not.", skinSay_capy_ep0: "I am almost Leonardo. Just cheaper.", skinSay_capy_ep1: "Retro is when everything is cool and nobody explains why.", skinSay_capy_ep2: "The disco ball spins, and so does the revenue!", skinSay_capy_ep3: "New game: \"Cashier vs. the Queue\". Hard level.", skinSay_capy_ep4: "The internet was invented to sell things. And cats, too.", skinSay_capy_ep5: "Eco trade: the bag is reusable, so is the profit.", skinSay_capy_ep6: "In space nobody hears the till. But we do.", skinSay_capy_ep7: "Neon blinks, prices do not. Principle!", skinSay_capy_wizard: "Abracadabra! And the goods are on the shelf. Well, they were delivered.", skinSay_capy_chef: "I do not cook, I stock up. But the hat is serious.", skinSay_capy_explorer: "The map says the treasure is somewhere near the till.", skinSay_capy_detective: "Who overcharged the customer? Elementary: the price tag.", skinSay_capy_sailor: "Calm in trade? Hoisting the sails, I mean the prices.", skinSay_shop_ice: "The ice shop: discounts do not melt here.", skinSay_shop_wood: "A wooden cabin smells of resin and honest business.", skinSay_shop_garden: "In the garden shop everything grows except prices. Almost.", skinSay_weather_cottoncloud: "Cotton candy clouds. Who took a bite? I am not saying anything.", skinSay_weather_goldcloud: "Golden clouds: even the sky decided to earn.", skinSay_weather_starcloud: "Starry clouds. Make a wish: a generous shopper!", skinSay_hero_chef: "Chef helpers! It smells tasty, but do not eat the goods.", skinSay_hero_wizard: "Wizard helpers: who said the queue cannot get shorter?", skinSay_hero_royal: "A royal team! Your Majesty, the till is on the right.", skinSay_street_wood: "The wooden path creaks. So trade is going well.", skinSay_street_brick: "Brick pavement: a clear road to the till.", skinSay_capy_santa: "Ho-ho-ho! Gifts at a discount, and the sack has plenty of room.", skinSay_capy_witch: "I am not a witch, I am a manager with a broom. But I wear the hat.", skinSay_capy_flower: "Flowers on me. Bees queue up, like everyone else.", skinSay_capy_beach: "A beach in the middle of town. Prices like a vacation!", skinSay_capy_autumn: "Autumn: the leaves fall, the revenue does not.", skinSay_hero_santa: "Santa’s helpers wrap gifts without a queue.", skinSay_hero_witch: "Little witch helpers: magically fast service.", skinSay_shop_xmas: "Christmas shop: the lights blink, the prices do not.", skinSay_shop_halloween: "Halloween shop: sweets or a discount!", skinSay_shop_spring: "Spring shop: prices are blooming. Gently, no panic.", skinSay_shop_autumn: "Autumn shop: warm, cozy, leaves on the roof.", skinSay_street_snow: "Snowy cobbles. Do not eat the snow! I stop myself too.", skinSay_street_leaves: "Leaves on the pavement: crunch-crunch, my favorite sound.",
